    "## 3. Data cleaning (leak-free)\n",
    "\n",
    "For each selected driver, independently:\n",
    "1. Remove pit-stop laps and the lap immediately after each stop — structural, no lap-time values involved.\n",
    "2. Split into stint-based train (earlier stints) / test (final stint).\n",
    "3. Compute the driver's median lap time **from the train rows only**.\n",
    "4. Remove laps exceeding 1.5× that **train-only** median from **both** train and test — the test set is cleaned using a threshold it had no part in computing, exactly as a scaler fit on train would be applied to test.\n",
    "\n",
    "Removal counts are tracked separately for train and test so the arithmetic stays transparent and nothing is double-counted."
   ]
  },
